1
00:00:00,719 --> 00:00:02,219
(Sheldon:)Bongo solo.

2
00:00:06,850 --> 00:00:09,350
Stop. Stop it. Stop. Stop.

3
00:00:09,561 --> 00:00:11,441
(Leonard:)Stop it.

4
00:00:16,276 --> 00:00:18,526
- What the hell?
- Oh, hi, Penny, guess what?

5
00:00:18,737 --> 00:00:20,907
(Leonard:)Sheldon got bongos.

6
00:00:21,114 --> 00:00:24,404
- Why did you get bongos?
- Richard Feynman played the bongos.

7
00:00:24,618 --> 00:00:25,828
l thought l'd try.

8
00:00:26,036 --> 00:00:27,616
(Leonard:)Feynman was a famous physicist.

9
00:00:27,829 --> 00:00:28,999
It's 3:00 in the morning.

10
00:00:29,206 --> 00:00:32,956
l don't care if Richard Feynman was a
purple leprechaun who lived in my butt.

11
00:00:34,169 --> 00:00:37,129
(Sheldon:)Penny meant
If he were a purple leprechaun

12
00:00:37,339 --> 00:00:41,299
(Sheldon:)Penny forgot to use the subjunctive

13
00:00:43,220 --> 00:00:45,600
(Leonard:)Sheldon, go to bed.
You have work in the morning.

14
00:00:45,806 --> 00:00:50,606
(Sheldon:)Maybe, maybe not. Maybe tomorrow
l start a bongo band and tour the world.

15
00:00:52,062 --> 00:00:55,772
No, hang on. Roommate Agreement.

16
00:00:55,983 --> 00:01:01,023
(Leonard:)No hootenannies, sing-a-longs,
or barbershop quartets after 10 p.m.

